                    124.0,
                    252.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) It shall be the responsibility of the Employer to see that employees driving equipment to the new job headquarters, when moving during the work week, to have transportation back to the old headquarters, on Company time, if necessary, to pick up personal transportation.",
            "block_bbox": [
