        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 5.14 When employees report at headquarters ready for work at 8:00 AM and cannot perform work because of inclement weather, material shortages or other reasons beyond their control, they shall receive three hours' reporting time provided they remain at headquarters during the three hour period unless released by foreman. If they are instructed by the foreman to report at 1:00 PM and are still unable to perform work for reasons mentioned above, they shall be paid another three hours' reporting time for the afternoon.",
